    "enUS": {
      "description": "Have you brought something to add to our collection?",
      "dialogue": {
        "7b8c320c99c46f8b9204": "Thank you, $N. You say this is from the Ironforge library? ...I'm sure they won't miss it.\n\nIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.",
